# What the working copy under $BUILD_ROOT/src does not take from Dropbox.
#
# Two roles, and the second is the dangerous one: the sync runs with --delete,
# so this is also the list of what survives there. node_modules, .venv, .quarto
# and the render in docs exist only in the working copy -- drop a line and the
# next sync destroys it. Patterns are rsync's; no trailing slashes, or a
# symlink of that name is matched as a file and deleted.
.git
.quarto
node_modules
.venv
docs
*conflicted copy*
.DS_Store
*_files
